Name: rust-harfbuzz
Short Name: rust-harfbuzz
URL: https://github.com/servo/rust-harfbuzz
Version: 0.8.0
Revision: 0d3ac4d874ed81a637c05f90d29ce4024b72c745
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py rust-harfbuzz, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-MIT
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
High-level Rust bindings to the HarfBuzz text shaping engine

Local Modifications:
The crates (3) live in third_party/rust-harfbuzz/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/rust-harfbuzz/ unchanged.

Crates:
  harfbuzz 0.8.0 third_party/rust-harfbuzz/harfbuzz
  harfbuzz-sys 0.8.0 third_party/rust-harfbuzz/harfbuzz-sys
  harfbuzz-traits 0.6.0 third_party/rust-harfbuzz/harfbuzz-traits
